<title>GERMANY: VEBA SIX MONTH PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>VEBA SIX MONTH PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  39,707  vs 36,588</p>
<p>    Group net profit				816  vs    743</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			1,748  vs  1,632</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of the German diversified utility group is Veba AG.</p>
<p>Veba said it expected 1997 profit to rise at least as fast as in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
